                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-calendar3"></i><span><strong>Timeline:</strong> 11 weeks</span></div>
                  <div class="meta-pill"><i class="bi bi-people"></i><span><strong>Team:</strong> 1 PM, 1 engineer, 1 QA</span></div>
